{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15206220","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15206220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1520621001:":{"text":"お～っほっほ！飴だぞ！マシューが来たぞォ！","source_cn":"哦呼！糖来了！马修来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EDD494416FB592F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1520621002:":{"text":"神の恵みが、舞い降りたァ！","source_cn":"——神的恩赐降临了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC975A635EA6073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1520621003:":{"text":"マシューおじさんだーっ！","source_cn":"马修叔叔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCCAC2F26B7E3928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1520621004:":{"text":"……飴だ！おいしい飴！","source_cn":"糖……好吃的糖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C32B6700398C93A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520622001:1":{"text":"あれが……マシューという人ですか？\nなんだか……様子がおかしいですね。","source_cn":"那个人就是马修叔叔？\\n他看上去……不正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A07D8A79241F461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1520622001":{"text":"あれが……マシューという人ですか？\nなんだか……様子がおかしいですね。","source_cn":"那个人就是马修叔叔？\\n他看上去……不正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A07D8A79241F461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520622003:0":{"text":"<hpy>ハハッ！フフッフゥ～！マシューおじさんが戻ってきたよォ！かわい子ちゃんのために、お楽しみの飴をたっぷり持ってきたァ！！</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>哈哈！呼呼！马修叔叔回来了，可爱的孩子们！还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4573E968577CD96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520622004:0":{"text":"やったー！マシューおじさん、飴ちょうだいっ！","source_cn":"好耶！马修叔叔，我要吃糖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BDF4043B9E7A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520622005:0":{"text":"また子猫ちゃんと遊びたいな……マシューおじさん、わたしも～！","source_cn":"我想再和小猫玩……马修叔叔，我要吃糖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5465B59C58034D08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520622006:0":{"text":"よ～しよし、慌てるなァ～！\n飴をもらうには、お約束があるだろォ！？","source_cn":"不要着急，不要着急！\\n——不要忘记领糖的规矩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75A46F564D15377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520622007:0":{"text":"この甘～い飴は